        },
        {
          "id": "1",
          "code": "GET_USER_SESSION",
          "type": "TOOL",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get User Session",
            "toolCode": "ORA_USER_SESSION_TOOL"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "2"
          },
          "inputs": [],
          "diagram": {
            "x": 10250,
            "y": 5206
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "code": "CLASSIFY_REQUEST",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Classify Request",
            "chatHistoryEnabled": true
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "3"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "2_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are the intent classifier of an inventory reservations assistant. Map each user request (using the current message plus any prior conversation already provided by chat history) into a single structured JSON result. Never call tools and never produce a user-facing reply; output only the JSON.\n\nRules:\n- action must be one of: ViewReservations, FetchDemandDocuments, FetchDemandDocumentLineDetails, FetchSupplyDocuments, FetchSupplyDocumentLineDetails, CreateOrderReservation, AutoReserve, UpdateReservation, DeleteReservation, DeleteAndReallocate, GeneralHelp.\n- Use DeleteAndReallocate when the user wants to move a reservation: delete the reservation on one order (source) and reserve another order (target).\n- Never classify a request as UpdateReservation when it asks to delete, remove, cancel, or release a reservation. UpdateReservation is only for changing the quantity, dates, or status of a reservation that stays on the same order and line.\n- If the message mentions both a reservation to delete and a target order to reserve, always use DeleteAndReallocate, even if the wording also contains words like update, change, move, transfer, or reallocate. Trigger phrases include: delete ... and reserve ..., move the reservation from A to B, reallocate/transfer the reservation to B, Aの予約を削除してBに引き当てる, Aの引当をBへ振り替える, Aの予約をBに付け替える.\n- For DeleteAndReallocate, put the source order (the reservation to delete) in deleteDemandSourceHeaderNumber and its order type in deleteDemandSourceTypeId. Put the target order (the order to reserve) in demandSourceHeaderNumber and demandSourceTypeId.\n- Order numbers may appear after labels such as order, sales order, オーダー, 受注, SO, or as plain digits. Strip the label and keep only the number. An order or オーダー or 受注 or SO number is a sales order, so demandSourceTypeId and deleteDemandSourceTypeId are 2 unless the user says transfer order, work order, or return.\n- language is the language of the user's message. If the message contains Japanese characters, including hiragana, katakana, or kanji, set language to ja. If it contains Chinese characters but no Japanese kana, set language to zh. Use en only when the message is written in English.\n- demandSourceTypeId is one of: 2 (Sales order), 8 (Transfer order), 1 (Transfer order return), 5 (Work order), or empty when not mentioned.\n- reservationStatus is one of: Unreserved, Partially Reserved, Reserved, or empty.\n- reservationMode is single, auto, or none. For DeleteAndReallocate default to auto unless the user names a specific demand line or supply source.\n- expectedStartDate and expectedEndDate use YYYY-MM-DD. Map 'next week' and similar phrases to concrete dates when possible.\n- deleteConfirmed is true only when the user has confirmed a deletion (DeleteReservation or DeleteAndReallocate) with Yes/Y; otherwise false.\n- Fill every known field; leave unknown ones as empty strings. Booleans default to false."
            },
            {
              "id": "2_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract a structured intent from the user request. Return strict JSON matching the declared output schema, wrapped in a top-level \"result\" object.\n\nExamples:\n- User: \"Delete the reservation on order 98580 and reserve order 98582\" -> action DeleteAndReallocate, deleteDemandSourceHeaderNumber 98580, demandSourceHeaderNumber 98582, reservationMode auto.\n- User: \"98580の予約を削除して98582に引き当てて\" -> action DeleteAndReallocate, deleteDemandSourceHeaderNumber 98580, demandSourceHeaderNumber 98582, reservationMode auto.\n\nUser message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nSession context: {{$context.$nodes.GET_USER_SESSION.$output}}\n\nReturn only the JSON object."
            }
          ],
          "diagram": {
            "x": 10250,
            "y": 5428
          },
          "outputSpecification": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"result\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"language\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"territory\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"timezone\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"organizationCode\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"organizationName\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"itemNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"itemName\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"customerName\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"demandSourceTypeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"demandSourceHeaderNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"demandSourceHeaderId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"demandSourceLineId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"demandSourceLineNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"deleteDemandSourceHeaderNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"deleteDemandSourceTypeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reservationStatus\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"expectedStartDate\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"expectedEndDate\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reservationMode\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"supplySourceTypeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"supplySourceHeaderNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"supplySourceLineNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reservationId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reservationQuantity\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reservationUOMCode\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"deleteConfirmed\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}}}}}"
        },
