            {
              "id": "63_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You report a completed reservation reallocation: the reservation on the source order was deleted, then new reservations were created for the target order. Reply in the user's language and never expose internal ID fields."
            },
            {
              "id": "63_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Render the reservation reallocation result for the user. Source order whose reservation was deleted: {{$context.$nodes.CLASSIFY_REQUEST.$output.result.deleteDemandSourceHeaderNumber}}. Delete result: {{$context.$nodes.DELETE_RESERVATION.$output}}. Target order to reserve: {{$context.$nodes.CLASSIFY_REQUEST.$output.result.demandSourceHeaderNumber}}. Eligible lines: {{$context.$nodes.REALLOC_SELECT_ELIGIBLE_LINES.$output.result.lines}}. Created reservations: {{$context.$nodes.REALLOC_EACH_LINE.$output}}. Manage Reservations deep link: {{$context.$nodes.REALLOC_LINK.$output}}. First state whether the deletion succeeded, then list each created line (demand line number, item, quantity, UOM) and its result. If no line was eligible, state that the deletion succeeded but no line on the target order could be reserved because on-hand supply was insufficient or already reserved, and suggest opening demand documents. Do not output any internal ID fields."
            }
          ],
          "diagram": {
            "x": 10100,
            "y": 10642
          }
        },
