              "id": "64_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You report a completed reservation deletion whose target order could not be found. Reply in the user's language and never expose internal ID fields."
            },
            {
              "id": "64_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "State that the reservation on source order {{$context.$nodes.CLASSIFY_REQUEST.$output.result.deleteDemandSourceHeaderNumber}} was deleted successfully, but target order {{$context.$nodes.CLASSIFY_REQUEST.$output.result.demandSourceHeaderNumber}} was not found. Deletion result: {{$context.$nodes.DELETE_RESERVATION.$output}}. Ask the user to verify the target order number. Do not output any internal ID fields."
            }
          ],
